 r←cloneList arg;n;ix
⍝ Space-separated names of the live per-session clones (mtest_1, mtest_2, …).
⍝
⍝ This is how a surviving session testifies about a departed one: after a
⍝ context closes, endSession.aplf:24 does ⎕EX on its clone, so the name
⍝ disappears from #.⎕NL 9 and hence from this list. Sorted by the numeric
⍝ suffix so assertions don't depend on ⎕NL's ordering.

 n←{⍵~' '}¨↓#.⎕NL 9
 n←n/⍨{'mtest_'≡6↑⍵}¨n

 :If 0=≢n
     r←'(none)'
 :Else
     ix←{⊃2⊃⎕VFI 6↓⍵}¨n
     n←n[⍋ix]
     r←1↓∊' ',¨n
 :EndIf
